    "enUS": {
      "description": "We been tryin' ta leave many a time, but keep gettin' pulled back ta defend our brothas an' sistas. Wit our defenses dwindlin', it's time we get ta restockin'.\r\n\r\nToday we be needin' arrows. Lots an' lots o' dem.\r\n\r\nFind dem big, beautiful birds and bring us back dem long feathers for da straight shootin' arrows.",
